Subject: [PATCH] Enrich destinations with tourism brochure facts

Expand the catalogue from 56 to 72 places using Department of Tourism
brochure distances, routes, and official descriptions. Add missing
falls, viewpoints, and temples; deepen existing summaries; split
lookalike places (Soor Mane vs Sirimane, Rani Jhari vs Jhari,
Devaramane vs Deviramma). Bump data.js cache query for clients.
