+                        "Chikkamagaluru 577101. Phone 08262-295422 / 7892886875. "
+                        "Email ckm.tourism@gmail.com. "
+                        "Brochure and district notes inform place facts on this companion; "
+                        "this is not a government booking desk."
+                    ),
+                }
+            )
+
